            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.39+LEV.23.40+LEV.23.41+LEV.23.42+LEV.23.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 23:39-43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuruga obu, buli ihanga ha mahanga goona agaasigaireho agaaseesiire Yerusaalemu, buli mwaka liraagendaga Yerusaalemu okuramya MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'amahe, n'okusemeza ekiro kikuru eky'ensiisira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha mahanga goona ag'ensi obu halibaho ihanga eriryanga kugenda Yerusaalemu kuramya MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'amahe, ihanga eri omunsi yalyo tihaligwamu njura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyamisiri obu balyanga kugyayo baligwerwa akabi MUKAMA akaalireetera amahanga goona agalyanga kusemeza ekiro kikuru eky'ensiisira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nikyo ekifubiro Misiri n'amahanga goona agalyanga kugenda kusemeza ekiro kikuru eky'ensiisira eki galitunga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, amajugo g'embaraasi galihandiikwaho ebigambo binu “Ekirukwera kya MUKAMA.” Kandi ebinaga eby'omunju ya MUKAMA, birisisana nk'ebbakuli ez'omumaiso g'itambiro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "buli kinaga kyona eky'omu rubuga Yerusaalemu na Yuda, kiriba kintu kirukwera kya MUKAMA ow'amahe, boona abaraabaga nibatamba ebyonzira, baraijaga babitwale babicumbiremu enyama ey'ekyonzira. Ekiro eki obu kirihika, abasuubuzi tibaligaruka kurangisibwa Omunju ya MUKAMA ow'amahe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
